It's not too often that you really get to know your son's friends.

27
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,000
I love the fact that whenever I see the boys out and about, they know my name and they say: hi,

28
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:12,000
I've got the bug and I will be hooked for life. I can tell

29
