31
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I'm looking forward to all of it and the fun and adventures that I have before me.

32
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Why me? Why now? And why scouting? Well, why not

33
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Jump right in? You won't regret a minute of it.

34
