and you keep that as limited

803
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:56,000
as possible

804
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:58,000
rather than laying down the law all weekend long.

805
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:00,000
we laid down the law before we left.

806
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:02,000
we're not leaving a messy campsite

807
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:04,000
